  "description": "Layout under stress: twenty-one nodes across four lines of thinking, with long labels. The board opens framed on the whole fan, which at this width falls below the scale where cards stay readable — so the galaxies give way to their cluster labels alone. That is designed behaviour and the reason the threshold sits so low: unreadable cards still carry how much thinking each line holds, and only once they degrade to single pixels is the label the more useful thing to draw."
